{"2815760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Absolute Insanity", "steam_appid": 2815760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3324330], "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bf07155ea885a32fcb74dd2adb5a72c3.poster.avif?t=1775355338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bf07155ea885a32fcb74dd2adb5a72c3.webm?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bf07155ea885a32fcb74dd2adb5a72c3.mp4?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in action-packed gameplay, where procedurally generated levels, and ever-evolving horrifying enemies adapt to your playstyle. <br><br>In Story Mode uncover the origins of these scary creatures and defeat them to unlock new items, levels, and enemies for Arena Mode. <br><br>Arena Mode allows you to customize levels, enemies, item drops, difficulty, and more to tailor your gaming experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/67c222ad5b580049dbee9292d338a46c.poster.avif?t=1775355338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/67c222ad5b580049dbee9292d338a46c.webm?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/67c222ad5b580049dbee9292d338a46c.mp4?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your gameplay will evolve into unique experiences from the procedurally altered levels, environmental hazards, and randomized item spawns, allowing multiple fresh playthroughs. <br><br>Created by a passionate solo developer this game offers an action horror experience like no other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/02ee9e7416e409586ed0c44c2b63ef25.poster.avif?t=1775355338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/02ee9e7416e409586ed0c44c2b63ef25.webm?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/02ee9e7416e409586ed0c44c2b63ef25.mp4?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Key features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> action packed gameplay<br></li><li> custom weapon creator<br></li><li> procedurally altered levels making each playthrough unique <br></li><li> destructible environments <br></li><li> unlocks and upgrades after you beat a level<br></li><li> different game modes including story and arena mode that allows you to customize levels <br></li><li> graphic settings, key rebinding, post processing effects settings, optimization settings, audio settings <br></li><li> 15 different language selections including: English, Chinese, French, German, Hindi, Italian, Japanese, Portuguese, Spanish, Korean, Russian, Polish, Thai, Vietnamese, and Indonesian</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bf07155ea885a32fcb74dd2adb5a72c3.poster.avif?t=1775355338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bf07155ea885a32fcb74dd2adb5a72c3.webm?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/bf07155ea885a32fcb74dd2adb5a72c3.mp4?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Immerse yourself in action-packed gameplay, where procedurally generated levels, and ever-evolving horrifying enemies adapt to your playstyle. <br><br>In Story Mode uncover the origins of these scary creatures and defeat them to unlock new items, levels, and enemies for Arena Mode. <br><br>Arena Mode allows you to customize levels, enemies, item drops, difficulty, and more to tailor your gaming experience. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/67c222ad5b580049dbee9292d338a46c.poster.avif?t=1775355338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/67c222ad5b580049dbee9292d338a46c.webm?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/67c222ad5b580049dbee9292d338a46c.mp4?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your gameplay will evolve into unique experiences from the procedurally altered levels, environmental hazards, and randomized item spawns, allowing multiple fresh playthroughs. <br><br>Created by a passionate solo developer this game offers an action horror experience like no other.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/02ee9e7416e409586ed0c44c2b63ef25.poster.avif?t=1775355338\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2815760/extras/02ee9e7416e409586ed0c44c2b63ef25.webm?t=1775355338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/